      ],
      "text": "PocketShell is described as a self-hosted, mobile-first remote terminal that brings a dev machine's terminal sessions into a phone browser for CLI/TUI coding agents or plain shell use."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c92c27e17d99410b79ddf603180a2e429b34d19daca72a5a9854925a3c41c780",
