          "url": "https://github.com/Big-Pony/pocketshell/blob/8aa6474e81400fa1896369f3920dbffaa6465585/README.md#L304-L312"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_68f5bcd7abe3cba4914a039325d237978d2ec846a3a16c8b7b01e2df417f0ad1"
      ],
      "text": "The stack comprises a Svelte 5 + Vite + xterm.js + CodeMirror 6 frontend, a Bun/TypeScript backend serving the embedded frontend and WebSocket on one port, tmux-managed PTYs, and bun:sqlite storage."
    },
